<title>USA: Cyclone threat to shipping in Timor Sea.</title>
<headline>Cyclone threat to shipping in Timor Sea.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, Mass. 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tropical Cyclone 15S (Rachel) is moving west-southwestward in the Timor Sea, between Indonesia and Australia, with top winds of 35 mph, independent forecaster Weather Services Corp said on Friday.</p>
<p>Slow intensification was expected as the storm continued on its track. This system will become an increasing threat to shipping over the next 24-72 hours.</p>
</text>
